{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30368","headline":"花园即事呈常中丞 · 赵嘏","name":"花园即事呈常中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟煖池塘柳覆台，百花园里看花来。\n烧衣焰席三千树，破鼻醒愁一万杯。\n不肯爲歌随拍落，却因令舞带香回。\n山公仰尔延宾客，好傍春风次第开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}